#: includes/help/admin-articles.php:442
msgid "Short answers to common questions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/help/admin-articles.php:445
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Can I use another currency?</strong> Yes – Settings › General › Currency code, then update the price brackets.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Can I hide the price?</strong> Tick “Price on request” in Property Details › Pricing.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Can I translate the site?</strong> Yes. All text uses the <code>makaazi</code> text domain, so tools like Loco Translate work.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Will updates overwrite my changes?</strong> Changes made in the editor, settings and listings are kept. Edits to theme or plugin files are lost – ask your developer to use a child theme.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>How do I back up?</strong> Use your host’s backup or a plugin such as UpdraftPlus. Back up both the database and the uploads folder.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>I need a developer feature.</strong> Your developer can find the separate developer documentation in the Makaazi repository under <code>docs/developer</code>.</p>"
msgstr ""

